{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_fmout_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_fmout_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "占卜",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_fmout_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a4009b10b9aa3f24bf60a03f8daf9077803f9f79613a260b72e8595360609af1",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "个人剧情 远山"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "周末\n羅德島食堂"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "總之，只要像這樣——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "牌就能很自然地從手中像水一樣落下——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "掉在手上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上課的小幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "哇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "學會了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上課的小幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "還沒有！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上課的小幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "遠山姐姐再表演一下嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "哼哼，那，看仔細了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上課的小幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "好——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上課的小幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "哇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "都看清楚了沒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上課的小幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "沒有——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "但是很遺憾，今天的牌藝課已經結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上課的小幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "嗚——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上課的小幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "再玩一會好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "那一會下一位在這裡上課的老師就要對我生氣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "大家也不想我被別的老師罵吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上課的小幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "就一會，就一會嘛，不會有事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "規矩可是很重要的，不能因為自己的欲望就隨意捨棄它哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "嗯——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "那麼，給大家佈置一個作業吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "如果有人可以在下周上課的時候給大家表演一下自己的練習成果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "那麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "就能從老師的百寶箱裡抽一個獎勵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上課的小幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "百寶箱？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上課的小幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "真的嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "真的哦，老師前兩天剛剛在百寶箱里加了點好玩的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "只要能鼓起勇氣給大家表演，每個人都有份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上課的小幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "耶！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "好啦下課，別忘了帶好自己的牌和玩具。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "我們下周見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上課的小幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "再見老師！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "哎呀，真是辛苦您了呐，課程還順利嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "說是上課，其實也就是陪孩子們玩樂而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "倒是你身上的擔比較重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "要教孩子們算清楚加減乘除，也是件費腦又費力的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "其實也沒那麼麻煩，算久了就懂了嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "而且我教的也不算數學，嗯，當初取的什麼名來著？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "“經營興趣班”？好像是叫這個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "哎呀其實和你一樣的啦，只管玩不管學。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "那可是件好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "畢竟做生意可是很殘酷的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "你可真瞭解啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "雖然並非本意，但占卜本質上也是種生意啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "你說的是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "那我就不打擾你佈置教室了，再會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "嗯——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "//此处替换成吃惊"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "對了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "遠山老師，請稍等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "還有什麼事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "是這樣的，您看，博士最近好像要和嘉維爾他們一起出趟遠門，去薩爾貢的一個角落裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "嗯嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "我呢，準備跟著一起去逛，看看能不能順帶做點買賣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "瞭解了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "所以啊，那個，能不能通——融一下，幫我算算？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "你應該知道——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "這個自然會有的，只是，嗯，那什麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "錢都拿去進貨了，現在手上真的沒有餘額。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "我不取錢財當報酬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "真的？太好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "但是我需要你一個承諾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "你要向我承諾——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "上課的時候不可以給孩子們推銷東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "//此处替换成吃惊"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "即使是零食，也不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "啊，哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "哎呀怎麼會呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "就算上課是玩，但我也有好好教學的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "有，或沒有，都與我無關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "我只是需要你的承諾作為代價。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "如果反悔的話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "誰知道呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "//此处替换成懊恼"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "意下如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "你的代價，我收下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "//此处替换成吃惊"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "不用契約書......之類的東西嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "我們的約定建立在彼此的信任上，不需要契約。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "那麼，開始吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "考慮到一會還要上課，我們就用簡單點的占法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "（取出塔羅）"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "//此处替换成吃惊"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "哇，這，這工藝？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "感覺每一張都能賣個好價錢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "這個把牌在桌上攤開以後轉啊轉的，是在洗牌嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "啊啊，請稍等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "直接像你課上那樣花洗也可以吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "有些占卜師的確會這樣行事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "但那太傷牌了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "就像在暴風雪中執拗前行的旅人，無論身體如何健壯，衣物如何保暖，溫度終究會被一絲一絲抽掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "等到失溫的那刻，再行補救終究無濟於事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "啊哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "只是個薩米人比較常用的比喻，我想你能理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "是是，我懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "好了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "嗯，好了，它們應該能為你解開些迷惑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "把牌收攏好，切一下，然後從你切的位置放三張牌下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "切記，先別翻開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "那遠山你豈不是啥都沒做嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "我只是為你解謎，自己的命運難道不應該由自己揭開嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "還是說，你樂意將命運交予他人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "好吧我知道了，我自己來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "收攏好......切牌......把三張牌背面朝上放在自己面前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "這樣就行吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "動作很乾脆，看來你並不迷茫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "那當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "那麼，請吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "以自己的想法翻開卡片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "總覺得你一本正經的，我也要有壓力了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "沒什麼好怕的，來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "翻開第一張。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "（翻牌）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "金杯的騎士，逆位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "我不太懂，正逆有什麼關係嘛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "簡單來說，逆位牌表明你現在受到了阻礙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "//此处替换成吃惊"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "啊？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "放輕鬆，所謂阻礙，並不是一件全然的壞事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "只是現在無法成功繼續下去而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "突破阻礙，成功或許就在不遠處了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "是這樣啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "讓我仔細看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "你是在經營上遇到問題了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "呃，算是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "基本上每個月都是這樣呢，有時候決策做錯了就沒錢賺，很頭疼的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "可能看見過機會，但沒抓住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "這種事對於做買賣的人來說天天都在發生啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "所以這次準備孤注一擲了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "我相信直覺，去嘉維爾老家一定能賺筆大的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "原來如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "根據我的瞭解，羅德島採購業務方面其實一直缺人手，只要你肯幫他們幹些活，錢不成問題，風險也大多會由羅德島分擔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "為什麼要選擇獨立經營呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "這個嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "習慣自己單幹啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "看來你的決策並非完全逐利呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "也沒你說的那麼大，就是見識下世面順便賺些錢補貼家用啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "好東西總是要花錢的嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "那這個，這個牌，簡單來說，是不是就是不太好啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "是過程不會太輕鬆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "//此处替换成吃惊"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "那我會不會就——遠山——救救我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "別急，這只是一個開端。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "來，翻開第二張。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "嗚嗚，好的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "（顫抖著翻牌）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "權杖一，正位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "//此处替换成吃惊"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "會，會是什麼呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "你抓住了機會，準備從中再次獲得自己於生命中的優勢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "雖然很危險，但是你信心滿滿向生活發起了挑戰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "聽上去像是好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "以前我為自己占卜的時候也曾翻到過它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "//此处替换成吃惊"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "唉——你們也會為自己占卜的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "在某個靈光閃現的時刻，占卜師完全可以窺探一下自己的道路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "我還以為占卜師只會收錢給別人辦事呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "金錢終究解決不了所有問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "並且，有些道路，外人是無法干涉的，只有透過與自己的談話，去摸索，去探求，才有機會尋到端倪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "還挺複雜的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "就像可頌你選擇以自己的力量做買賣。所有決策，任何選擇，都是多年商業經驗的結晶，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "他人能給出的只是建議，決定權永遠在自己手中——就像現在這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "即使三張牌都是最壞的結果，你真就會改變決策嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "//此处替换成懊恼"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "錢都花了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "所以你只是來求個安慰，希望我能說出一個聽上去舒服的結果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "啊不用回答我，很多人都是這樣的，我非常理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "大家在舉棋不定的時候，總會希望有什麼不實在的東西來解決一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "可惜，我並不是你們所期盼的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "我所能做的，只是淺窺前路，並奉上力所能及的幫助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "你支付了報酬，我就有義務竭盡全力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "僅此而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "遠山......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "讓我們繼續吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "好，好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "你會經歷冒險，但旅途似乎並不會平靜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "至於結果，我們可以期待最後一張牌所揭示的答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "盡頭說不定連一張龍門幣都沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "//此处替换成吃惊"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "感覺越來越危險了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "我只是說了一種較壞的可能性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "真的賺到缽滿盆滿也並不是沒可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "真是這樣就好啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "那我到時候要去調香師那裡做一整套的香氛助眠療程。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "帳單就拜託你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "賺到錢我就幫你付款！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "哼哼，一言為定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "那麼，讓我們來探索你這次旅途的終點吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "最後一張牌，請。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "（唰地翻開塔羅牌）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "雙月，正位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "是正位啊，還好還好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "這可......不好說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "你......有沒有瞭解過嘉維爾老家的情況？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "我調查過薩爾貢市場，這些絕對好賣的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "如果是這樣，那最好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "（會不會有不是尋常薩爾貢市場的可能性呢......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "（正位雙月......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "旅途不會平靜，前面的牌也都預示了這一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "小心被蒙蔽、小心被欺騙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "我的意見是，如果可以，請謹慎行事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "你喜歡月亮嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "喜歡也算不上吧，不過煩悶的時候在甲板上看看月亮，心情是會好些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "那月影呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "嗯，有人會特別去看影子嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "在月亮的光輝之下，經常有東西會被忽視。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "這張牌揭示的東西，也是如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "總有東西會被光輝遮蓋，會被刻意隱藏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "是福是禍，需要自己仔細斟酌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "好，我會注意的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "這張牌所要展示的，應該就是這些了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "結合三張牌向你揭示的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "可頌，你的未來並不輕鬆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "至少跟著博士一起出發的這次旅行，阻礙很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "你自己有這樣的感覺嗎？比如心裡隱約的不安和迷惑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "有一點吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "但，撐一撐應該能過去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "//此处替换成吃惊"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "這個，牌裡有說我投資必失敗嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "沒有，再者塔羅也從不會出現言之鑿鑿的未來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "那我應該還有救。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "實在不行，敲個儲蓄罐應該還能撐幾天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "但願如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "占卜的話，到此就結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "還有什麼需要我做的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "遠山，你也抽一張吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "你剛剛不是也說了嗎，占卜師自己也會占卜的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "我想看看你運氣怎麼樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "但那是在我準備——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "來嘛來嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "塔羅可不是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "哎呀別管了抽嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "（“請”遠山抓了張牌。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "來嘛，翻開吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "等等，我準備一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "（翻開塔羅牌）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "聖杯十......逆位......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "//此处替换成吃惊"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "這個是不好的意思嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "那我把它倒一下——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "等等別碰牌！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "//此处替换成吃惊"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "哦好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "對不起啊遠山。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "不對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "牌的正逆以翻牌者為準。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "所以這張牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "是正位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "哦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "對喔！你坐我對面！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "那這個牌，是不是好的意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "對我的職業和人際關係來說，很不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "那麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "（抓住遠山的手蹭了幾下）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "讓我向你借一點好運吧，這樣我就能回本了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "你要是這樣堅持的話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "請隨意......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "嗚嗚一定要讓我回本啊啊啊啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "//此处替换成吃惊"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "我突然想到一件事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "如果我借了你的運氣，那剛剛的占卜是不是全都不算數了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "誰知道呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "原來沒有這種規矩的啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "需要再占卜一次的話，可要重新支付報酬哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "那還是算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "我多蹭幾下，應該不收錢吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "哼哼~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "就算給你打個折，不收錢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "謝謝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "五分鐘後"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上課的小幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "可頌老師，我來啦！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上課的小幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "遠山老師也在啊，您好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "哦噢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "你們好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "那麼，我先走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "祝你賺到的龍門幣能填滿整個羅德島。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "下次有東西要買記得找我啊，我給你打個大折扣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "時運可是千變萬化的，到時候再詳談吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "（揮揮手離開）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠山",
      "speakerId": "char_109_fmout",
      "text": "（希望我的運勢真的能幫到你，可頌。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
